cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file. After the first Zenodo archive is created, cite the Zenodo DOI for the exact released version."
title: "htc-heom-fast: Matrix-free scaled HEOM dynamics for symmetric HTC/Tavis-Cummings models"
authors:
  - family-names: "Mondal"
    given-names: "Mohammad Elious"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-05-27"
license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/eliousmondal/htc-heom-fast"
url: "https://github.com/eliousmondal/htc-heom-fast"
abstract: "A small research-oriented Python/Numba package for matrix-free scaled hierarchical equations of motion simulations of symmetric Holstein-Tavis-Cummings and Tavis-Cummings models in the first-excitation manifold with site-local Drude-Lorentz baths."
keywords:
  - "hierarchical equations of motion"
  - "HEOM"
  - "scaled HEOM"
  - "Holstein-Tavis-Cummings"
  - "Tavis-Cummings"
  - "exciton polaritons"
  - "open quantum systems"
